WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.003
I'm going to Vietnam and I'm
bringing 'em beer!

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:04.504
(All) Yeah!

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:09.468
♪♪

00:00:09.468 --> 00:00:10.552
Rick:
Are you ready?

00:00:10.552 --> 00:00:11.553
What are we doing?

00:00:12.554 --> 00:00:13.680
We're gonna run for our lives.

00:00:15.098 --> 00:00:22.397
(Artillery fire)

00:00:22.773 --> 00:00:23.982
We're halfway home.

00:00:23.982 --> 00:00:24.733
Halfway?!

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:28.111
(Ding)
I'm Chickie Donohue, and I am
not supposed to be in Vietnam.

00:00:28.111 --> 00:00:30.155
♪♪

00:00:30.155 --> 00:00:32.783
Hey, get your ass out of
bed, you lazy bum.

00:00:32.783 --> 00:00:34.785
Mr. Donohue:
Look at you, sleeping your life
away.

00:00:35.118 --> 00:00:35.535
♪♪

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:36.453
Red:
Look at these scumbags.

00:00:36.453 --> 00:00:37.454
(Protest chants)

00:00:37.454 --> 00:00:40.457
Hey! You're embarrassing
yourself, and you're
embarrassing your family.

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:45.128
Do these protesters not know
that our soldiers see them on
TV.

00:00:45.128 --> 00:00:46.630
I'd like to go over to Vietnam.

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:48.757
The Colonel:
Track down all the boys in the
neighborhood and

00:00:48.757 --> 00:00:49.758
give 'em a beer.

00:00:49.758 --> 00:00:50.717
I could do that.

00:00:51.093 --> 00:00:51.718
Do what?

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:52.719
Bring 'em beer.

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:54.888
He's not serious, he's hammered.
Look at him.

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:58.517
The man is stone sober.
That's his fifth beer, maybe,
tops.

00:00:58.517 --> 00:01:00.894
I'm going to Vietnam, and I'm
bringing 'em beer!

00:01:00.894 --> 00:01:01.770
(All)
Yeah!

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:03.105
♪♪

00:01:03.105 --> 00:01:05.440
Hey chief, no chance you have a
ship going to Vietnam?

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:06.608
1700 hours.

00:01:06.608 --> 00:01:07.359
Tonight?

00:01:07.359 --> 00:01:07.985
♪♪

00:01:07.985 --> 00:01:09.194
Chickie:
It's not gonna be easy.

00:01:09.194 --> 00:01:12.155
Chickie:
But I'm gonna show them that
this country is still behind them.

00:01:12.155 --> 00:01:13.532
You're gonna get yourself killed
over there.

00:01:13.532 --> 00:01:15.784
It's like you said, everyone's
doing something.

00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:17.327
I'm doing nothing.

00:01:17.327 --> 00:01:19.496
♪One morning I woke up♪

00:01:19.496 --> 00:01:21.540
Arthur Coates:
Smuggling beer into a war-zone,

00:01:21.915 --> 00:01:23.917
Arthur Coates:
it's not the smartest thing I've
ever heard of.

00:01:24.293 --> 00:01:25.627
It's certainly not the worst
either.

00:01:25.877 --> 00:01:28.755
♪A new day, a new way♪

00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:30.424
What if you start up here with
Collins...

00:01:30.424 --> 00:01:32.009
Aaah!
-Haha!

00:01:32.009 --> 00:01:34.428
Just came to deliver a sudsy
thank you card.

00:01:34.428 --> 00:01:36.096
Kevin:
...and then, if you're still
alive...

00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:37.556
(Honking)
(Traffic)

00:01:37.556 --> 00:01:38.265
You American?

00:01:38.265 --> 00:01:39.308
New York!

00:01:39.308 --> 00:01:40.017
Chickie:
Thanks a lot.

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:41.893
Kevin:
...you can hustle down to
Duggan.

00:01:43.061 --> 00:01:44.146
Ta-da.

00:01:44.688 --> 00:01:45.188
Chickie?

00:01:45.188 --> 00:01:46.023
I brought you beer.

00:01:46.023 --> 00:01:47.024
♪♪

00:01:47.024 --> 00:01:48.025
You shouldn't be here.

00:01:48.025 --> 00:01:49.026
Rick:
You think this is funny?

00:01:49.026 --> 00:01:49.693
(Shoots-off flare)

00:01:49.693 --> 00:01:50.861
Chickie:
I'm not doing this for laughs,

00:01:50.861 --> 00:01:52.404
Chickie:
I'm doing it for all you guys.

00:01:52.404 --> 00:01:53.655
♪♪

00:01:53.655 --> 00:01:55.073
Whoa-whoa!
Hey!

00:01:56.033 --> 00:01:57.659
Come on, time to go.

00:01:57.659 --> 00:01:58.160
Is it over?

00:01:58.827 --> 00:01:59.953
Yeah, you're dead.

00:01:59.953 --> 00:02:02.789
♪Carry on♪

00:02:02.789 --> 00:02:03.874
Rick:
You don't get it, do you, Chick.

00:02:03.874 --> 00:02:05.042
This isn't a John Wayne movie

00:02:05.375 --> 00:02:06.376
Rick:
where you know who the good guys
are

00:02:06.376 --> 00:02:07.794
Rick:
and you know who the bad guys
are.

00:02:08.045 --> 00:02:10.464
♪Love is coming♪

00:02:10.464 --> 00:02:12.049
I didn't come all this way 
just to quit.

00:02:12.382 --> 00:02:14.134
Arthur Coates:
Somebody's gotta be here to see
what's going on.

00:02:14.134 --> 00:02:14.885
♪♪

00:02:14.885 --> 00:02:16.136
Arthur Coates:
I want the truth told...

00:02:16.136 --> 00:02:17.304
♪♪

00:02:17.304 --> 00:02:18.221
...for them.

00:02:18.221 --> 00:02:18.889
♪♪

00:02:18.889 --> 00:02:19.890
Arthur Coates:
They're just kids.

00:02:20.432 --> 00:02:24.478
You're gonna find out it's a lot
 harder to get out of a war than
it is to get into one.

00:02:24.478 --> 00:02:27.773
Chickie:
I'm trying to show them that
somebody back home is still behind them.

00:02:27.773 --> 00:02:29.483
♪♪

00:02:29.483 --> 00:02:30.901
Rick:
You got a good heart, Chickie.

00:02:30.901 --> 00:02:32.361
It's your brain I'm worried
about.

00:02:32.361 --> 00:02:34.279
♪♪

00:02:34.279 --> 00:02:37.074
♪Carry on♪

00:02:37.074 --> 00:02:38.075
Who's this hand-job?

00:02:38.325 --> 00:02:39.409
My next-door neighbor.

00:02:39.409 --> 00:02:40.327
He brought me a beer.

00:02:40.327 --> 00:02:41.536
♪♪

00:02:41.536 --> 00:02:42.454
Hey.

00:02:42.454 --> 00:02:44.414
♪♪

